ent-STTurretARES = UA X512-S mini sentry
    .desc = A compact defence turret slaved to the ARES security grid. It deploys from the floor whenever the AI core detects hostile activity.
ent-STDeployerSentryARES = ARES sentry deployment system
    .desc = A floor hatch housing an ARES core defence turret. It deploys automatically when xenomorphs, resin or personnel without UNMC IFF are detected nearby.
